WEBVTT

00:14.750 --> 00:18.543
I know exactly what
I'm gonna eat today!
我确切地知道什么
今天我要吃饭！

00:20.302 --> 00:23.681
Wait, why did I come in here, again?
等等，我怎么又进来了？

00:23.681 --> 00:26.750
- Lemme guess--
- Don't tell me.
- 让我猜猜--
- 别告诉我。

00:27.888 --> 00:31.750
Hmm, starts with a K.
嗯，以 K 开头。

00:31.750 --> 00:33.336
Uhh--
呃——

00:43.302 --> 00:45.233
Uhh--
呃——

00:47.785 --> 00:49.819
♪ Throwin' patties
on the grill ♪
♪ 扔肉饼
在烤架上♪

00:49.819 --> 00:51.026
♪ Juggling ingredients ♪
- Ow, ow!
♪ 杂耍配料 ♪
- 噢，噢！

00:51.026 --> 00:52.233
♪ Trying not to spill ♪
♪ 尽量不要洒出来 ♪

00:52.233 --> 00:53.302
♪ The grill aflame ♪
♪ 烤架着火了 ♪

00:53.302 --> 00:54.543
♪ Work is a game ♪
♪ 工作就是一场游戏 ♪

00:54.543 --> 00:56.026
♪ When I'm done,
you'll have a bun ♪
♪ 当我完成后
你会得到一个小圆面包♪

00:56.026 --> 00:57.233
♪ Full of yum, yum, yum ♪
♪ 充满美味，美味，美味 ♪

00:57.233 --> 01:00.164
Huh?
啊？

01:00.164 --> 01:01.543
Yes!
是的！

01:01.543 --> 01:04.509
My plan is working perfectly.
我的计划正在完美地进行。

01:04.509 --> 01:06.233
Minus the third degree burns.
减去三度烧伤。

01:06.233 --> 01:07.336
Ooh!
哦！

01:07.336 --> 01:10.923
Ahh!
啊！

01:13.405 --> 01:15.474
And now, for my clever escape.
现在，为了我巧妙的逃脱。

01:15.474 --> 01:17.267
Hey! Where do you think
you're going?
嘿！你认为哪里
你要去吗？

01:17.267 --> 01:18.440
- Ahh!
- Trying to sneak out
- 啊！
- 试图溜出去

01:18.440 --> 01:19.992
before the big delivery, huh?
在大发货之前吧？

01:19.992 --> 01:22.198
No need to get cold feet,
little patty.
无需临阵退缩，
小帕蒂。

01:22.198 --> 01:24.095
You'll be very happy
in your new home.
你会很高兴的
在你的新家。

01:24.095 --> 01:25.302
Oh, no!
哦，不！

01:25.302 --> 01:26.854
I'm gonna be late
for my delivery!
我要迟到了
为了我的交货！

01:28.785 --> 01:29.819
Whoop!
哎哟！

01:49.750 --> 01:52.647
Don't worry, little patty,
you're almost home.
别担心，小帕蒂
你快到家了。

01:52.647 --> 01:54.681
Huh? Ohh!
啊？哦！

01:54.681 --> 01:55.992
Wait!
等待！

01:57.302 --> 01:58.612
Whoa!
哇！

01:58.612 --> 02:00.543
Ohh!
哦！

02:08.198 --> 02:09.957
Whoa!
哇！

02:09.957 --> 02:12.509
Hey, something soft
broke my fall.
嘿，软软的东西
打破了我的跌倒。

02:12.509 --> 02:13.923
Thanks, patty.
谢谢，帕蒂。

02:15.681 --> 02:17.543
Patty,
帕蒂，

02:17.543 --> 02:20.095
I don't think
we're in Bikini Bottom anymore.
我不认为
我们已经在比基尼泳裤了。

02:22.716 --> 02:25.371
We must be lost
in the deep Goo Sea.
我们一定会迷失
在咕海深处。

02:25.371 --> 02:27.612
I guess we'll miss
the delivery.
我想我们会错过
交货。

02:27.612 --> 02:30.681
I've let down
poor, old Mr. Krabs.
我已经失望了
可怜的老蟹先生。

02:30.681 --> 02:32.233
Hey, where are you going?
嘿，你要去哪里？

02:32.233 --> 02:34.543
I'm just going to the, uh...
我只是要去，呃...

02:34.543 --> 02:35.957
little patty's room?
小帕蒂的房间？

02:35.957 --> 02:38.716
Oh, why didn't you say so?
哦，你为什么不这么说？

02:38.716 --> 02:42.716
I'll discreetly turn around
and give you a little privacy.
我会小心翼翼地转身
并给你一点隐私。

02:43.888 --> 02:45.095
Hey, wait a minute.
嘿，等一下。

02:45.095 --> 02:47.026
I don't make little patties.
我不做小馅饼。

02:48.267 --> 02:50.371
Nice try, Plankton.
不错的尝试，浮游生物。

02:52.474 --> 02:54.095
Get back here.
回到这里吧。

02:58.267 --> 03:00.129
Wait a minute,
we're marooned!
等一下，
我们被困了！

03:00.129 --> 03:02.095
We have to make
this patty last.
我们必须做
最后这个肉饼。

03:02.095 --> 03:04.923
It's our only food
until we're rescued.
这是我们唯一的食物
直到我们获救。

03:06.198 --> 03:08.026
So?
What's your point?
所以？
你的观点是什么？

03:08.026 --> 03:11.336
If we're gonna survive,
we'll have to share.
如果我们要活下去
我们必须分享。

03:11.336 --> 03:13.854
Huh, share?
呵呵，分享一下？

03:13.854 --> 03:17.129
You've got yourself a deal,
big boy!
你已经和自己达成了协议，
大男孩！

03:17.129 --> 03:19.371
Aww, put 'er there, pal.
哇，把它放在那里，朋友。

03:19.371 --> 03:21.267
Here, you can have
the first bite.
在这里，你可以拥有
第一口。

03:21.267 --> 03:22.681
Make it a small one.
让它变小一点。

03:22.681 --> 03:26.474
Don't mind if I do.
如果我这样做的话，请不要介意。

03:26.474 --> 03:29.233
That's strange.
这很奇怪。

03:29.233 --> 03:31.336
Uh, Plankton?
呃，浮游生物？

03:31.336 --> 03:34.233
This patty tastes
a little... angry.
这个饼的味道
有点……生气。

03:34.233 --> 03:35.233
Plankton.
浮游生物。

03:38.095 --> 03:40.026
Whaa!
哇！

03:40.026 --> 03:41.543
Whoa-oh!
哇哦！

03:47.371 --> 03:49.233
Plankton!
You're okay!
浮游生物！
你没事吧！

03:49.233 --> 03:51.336
Oh, I thought I lost you.
哦，我以为我失去了你。

03:51.336 --> 03:53.302
Uhh, SpongeBob?
呃，海绵宝宝？

04:00.164 --> 04:02.026
Whoa!
哇！

04:02.026 --> 04:07.578
Ahh! Ahh! Ahh!
啊！啊！啊！

04:10.129 --> 04:14.371
Ahh!
啊！

04:14.371 --> 04:15.957
Enough!
足够的！

04:15.957 --> 04:17.474
Sorry.
对不起。

04:19.129 --> 04:22.405
We have to start looking for
shelter before it gets dark.
我们必须开始寻找
天黑之前避难。

04:22.405 --> 04:24.233
What about Mr. Snake Monster?
蛇怪先生呢？

04:24.233 --> 04:25.888
Can he come stay with us?
他能来和我们一起住吗？

04:25.888 --> 04:27.267
No.
不。

04:27.267 --> 04:29.095
Sorry. I tried.
对不起。我试过。

04:32.302 --> 04:35.233
Not too shabby.
不太破旧。

04:35.233 --> 04:36.681
Yep.
是的。

04:39.095 --> 04:41.474
Plankton, could you move
your leg over a little?
浮游生物，你能动一下吗
你的腿有点过了吗？

04:41.474 --> 04:43.543
It's a bit cramped in here.
这里有点局促。

04:46.992 --> 04:50.509
Hey, lucky these thorns
broke our fall.
嘿，幸运的是这些荆棘
打破了我们的跌倒。

04:50.509 --> 04:52.888
Yeah, lucky me.
是的，我很幸运。

04:56.026 --> 04:58.819
Hey, this place looks
pretty spacious.
嘿，这个地方看起来
相当宽敞。

04:58.819 --> 05:01.198
We can really do a lot
with this place.
我们真的可以做很多
与这个地方。

05:01.198 --> 05:02.578
Over there can be your room.
那边可能是你的房间。

05:02.578 --> 05:04.198
That could be my room.
那可能是我的房间。

05:04.198 --> 05:06.440
Oh, it's a little dark
back here, isn't it?
哦，有点暗
回到这里，不是吗？

05:06.440 --> 05:08.095
Hey, I can hear my echo.
嘿，我能听到我的回声。

05:08.095 --> 05:11.612
Does it feel a little
wet in here to you?
是不是感觉有点
你这里湿了吗？

05:11.612 --> 05:13.405
Hey, look.
I found a light switch.
嘿，看。
我找到了一个电灯开关。

05:22.233 --> 05:23.612
Oh, hey, Plankton.
哦，嘿，浮游生物。

05:24.474 --> 05:25.681
New plan.
新计划。

05:25.681 --> 05:27.302
Let's grab a bite to eat.
我们去吃点东西吧。

05:29.819 --> 05:32.923
Ooh, look! Bananers!
哦，看！香蕉！

05:32.923 --> 05:34.026
Hmm.
唔。

05:34.026 --> 05:35.612
Gah. Wha!
嘎。世界卫生大会！

05:37.233 --> 05:39.302
Finally, some grub!
最后，一些幼虫！

05:39.302 --> 05:41.198
Let's eat.
我们吃饭吧。

05:41.198 --> 05:43.267
Mama!
妈妈！

05:43.267 --> 05:44.509
both: Aww!
两人：哇！

05:44.509 --> 05:45.923
Gah!
嘎！

05:51.888 --> 05:53.440
Uhh.
呃。

05:53.440 --> 05:55.129
Oh!
哦！

06:06.854 --> 06:08.612
Should we eat this rock?
我们应该吃这块石头吗？

06:08.612 --> 06:10.302
I'll eat anything.
我什么都吃。

06:19.992 --> 06:21.129
Ohh!
哦！

06:26.233 --> 06:27.302
Ohh!
哦！

06:27.302 --> 06:29.750
Leave us alone!
别管我们了！

06:32.267 --> 06:33.957
Hey!
嘿！

06:34.819 --> 06:36.336
both: Aha!
两人：啊哈！

06:56.474 --> 06:59.060
Mmm.
嗯。

07:10.612 --> 07:12.267
Hup!
both: Ah!
哈！
两人：啊！

07:12.267 --> 07:14.060
- Hup!
- Yeah!
- 哈！
- 是的！

07:15.992 --> 07:17.785
Great work out there today.
今天的表现很棒。

07:19.095 --> 07:22.785
Ohh, it's just not the same
without you.
哦，只是不一样
没有你。

07:25.267 --> 07:28.129
It's just not the
same without you.
这只是不是
没有你也一样。

07:29.957 --> 07:32.233
SpongeBob?
- Yes, Plankton?
海绵宝宝？
- 是的，浮游生物？

07:32.233 --> 07:34.509
Are you thinkin'
what I'm thinkin'?
你在想吗
我在想什么？

07:34.509 --> 07:36.371
Yep, I can't decide either.
是的，我也无法决定。

07:36.371 --> 07:39.750
Do the company sports jerseys
look better in beige or green?
公司有运动衫吗
米色或绿色更好看？

07:39.750 --> 07:41.474
No, you imbecile.
不，你这个白痴。

07:41.474 --> 07:43.923
It's time for us to am-scray
and get back home
是时候让我们开始尖叫了
然后回家

07:43.923 --> 07:45.992
without the monsters noticing.
在怪物不注意的情况下。

07:50.267 --> 07:52.405
They're watching us everywhere, Plankton.
他们到处监视着我们，浮游生物。

07:52.405 --> 07:53.888
Run for it!
奔跑吧！

07:56.371 --> 07:58.509
Yah! Nose dive!
啊！鼻子俯冲！

07:58.509 --> 08:01.681
both: Whoa, whoa, whoa!
两人：哇哇哇！

08:01.681 --> 08:05.267
Too many monsters!
怪物太多了！

08:05.267 --> 08:06.957
Ahh!
啊！

08:12.026 --> 08:14.681
SpongeBob, I have an idea.
海绵宝宝，我有一个主意。

08:14.681 --> 08:16.405
Follow my lead.
跟随我的引导。

08:16.405 --> 08:18.440
All right, monsters.
好吧，怪物们。

08:18.440 --> 08:22.750
We'll go back to work and whip
up some nice coconut patties.
我们会回去工作并鞭打
一些美味的椰子馅饼。

08:22.750 --> 08:27.267
In fact, we have a big,
delicious surprise for you.
事实上，我们有一个很大的，
给你美味的惊喜。

08:27.267 --> 08:29.543
You just have to
close your eyes.
你只需要
闭上你的眼睛。

08:32.681 --> 08:36.336
Good! Now stick your fingers
in your ears and sing,
好的！现在伸出你的手指
在你耳边歌唱，

08:36.336 --> 08:39.026
♪ La la la la
la la la ♪
♪ 啦啦啦啦
啦啦啦♪

08:39.026 --> 08:41.440
all: ♪ La la la la
la la la ♪
全体：♪ 啦啦啦啦
啦啦啦♪

08:41.440 --> 08:44.819
Now, run!
现在，跑吧！

08:44.819 --> 08:46.612
both: Whoa!
两人：哇！

08:46.612 --> 08:47.957
Yeah!
是的！

08:58.164 --> 08:59.819
Ahh.
啊。

09:01.060 --> 09:03.405
Goodbye, friends
who kept us captive
再见，朋友们
谁囚禁了我们

09:03.405 --> 09:05.129
by threatening to eat us!
威胁要吃掉我们！

09:05.129 --> 09:06.854
Great thinking back there, Plankton.
浮游生物，你的想法很棒。

09:06.854 --> 09:09.681
How about we celebrate
our victory?
我们庆祝一下怎么样
我们的胜利？

09:09.681 --> 09:12.026
both: Cheers!
两人：干杯！

09:12.026 --> 09:16.060
Hm, wait. Why are we heading
back to the island?
嗯，等等。我们为何前进
回岛了？

09:16.060 --> 09:20.095
I think the island
is heading back to us.
我认为岛
正在返回我们身边。

09:20.095 --> 09:21.164
Uh-oh.
呃哦。

09:23.647 --> 09:26.233
Ahh!
啊！

09:32.923 --> 09:34.543
Comin' through!
来了！

09:34.543 --> 09:36.888
- Hm?
- Ahh!
- 嗯？
- 啊！

09:38.612 --> 09:40.371
Ohh!
哦！

09:40.371 --> 09:42.405
Hm? Phew.
嗯？唷。

09:48.819 --> 09:50.440
That was a close one.
那是一场很接近的比赛。

09:55.509 --> 09:57.233
You're late, SpongeBob.
你迟到了，海绵宝宝。

09:57.233 --> 09:59.405
Where have you been
the last six years?
你去哪儿了
过去六年？

10:00.681 --> 10:02.302
Mr. Krabs!
蟹老板！

10:02.302 --> 10:05.992
Well, it was nice
while it lasted.
嗯，很好
当它持续的时候。

10:09.302 --> 10:12.302
It's an earthquake!
Run for your lives!
这是地震！
为你的生命而奔跑！

10:12.302 --> 10:16.888
Ahh!
Oh, ohh!
啊！
哦，哦！

10:16.888 --> 10:19.095
No! Not me restaurant!
不！不是我的餐厅！

10:27.888 --> 10:29.957
I know what I want
to eat today!
我知道我想要什么
今天吃饭！

10:29.957 --> 10:32.681
I'll have one coco patty.
我要一份可可馅饼。

10:32.681 --> 10:35.509
Comin' right up,
for a nominal service charge.
马上就来了，
收取象征性的服务费。

10:35.509 --> 10:38.785
All's well
that ends well, eh, Plankton?
一切都好
结局很好，嗯，浮游生物？

10:38.785 --> 10:40.371
Oh, no!
哦，不！

10:40.371 --> 10:41.578
Where's Plankton?
浮游生物在哪里？

10:46.957 --> 10:51.336
Rawr, rawr,
we're alone at last.
拉尔，拉尔，
我们终于孤独了。

10:51.336 --> 10:53.198
Muah.
么么哒。

么么哒。